"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_luna_04_01#51","rawText":"嗯？等等，你是說是我的原因嗎！","displayText":"嗯？等等，你是說是我的原因嗎！","spans":[{"text":"嗯？等等，你是說是我的原因嗎！"}],"shake":true}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":171,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":true},{"imgId":174,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"shake":true,"isDark":false}],"heroFace":[{"imgId":174,"faceId":2}]},"next":"cpt_luna_04_01#52"},"cpt_luna_04_01#52":{"id":"cpt_luna_04_01#52","act":52,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"name":"智慧體","rawName":"智慧體","isProfessor":false,"lookup":"지능체"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_luna_04_01#52","rawText":"咦？這不是月光和葉蓮娜嗎？","displayText":"咦？這不是月光和葉蓮娜嗎？","spans":[{"text":"咦？這不是月光和葉蓮娜嗎？"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":174,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}]},"next":"cpt_luna_04_01#53"},"cpt_luna_04_01#53":{"id":"cpt_luna_04_01#53","act":53,"kind":"narration","units":[{"uid":"cpt_luna_04_01#53","rawText":"或許是兩個人打鬧的動靜吸引了其他人，休息區中不知道誰率先喊出了月光和葉蓮娜的名字。","displayText":"或許是兩個人打鬧的動靜吸引了其他人，休息區中不知道誰率先喊出了月光和葉蓮娜的名字。","spans":[{"text":"或許是兩個人打鬧的動靜吸引了其他人，休息區中不知道誰率先喊出了月光和葉蓮娜的名字。"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":171,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":0,"isDark":true},{"imgId":174,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":0,"isDark":false}]},"next":"cpt_luna_04_01#54"},"cpt_luna_04_01#54":{"id":"cpt_luna_04_01#54","act":54,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"name":"智慧體","rawName":"智慧體","isProfessor":false,"lookup":"지능체"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_luna_04_01#54","rawText":"聽說她們兩個依靠占卜解決了外勤的難題。","displayText":"聽說她們兩個依靠占卜解決了外勤的難題。","spans":[{"text":"聽說她們兩個依靠占卜解決了外勤的難題。"}]}],"next":"cpt_luna_04_01#55"},"cpt_luna_04_01#55":{"id":"cpt_luna_04_01#55","act":55,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"name":"智慧體","rawName":"智慧體","isProfessor":false,"lookup":"지능체"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_luna_04_01#55","rawText":"嗯？難道是不是她們依靠占卜計算擊敗了數十隻熵嗎？","displayText":"嗯？難道是不是她們依靠占卜計算擊敗了數十隻熵嗎？","spans":[{"text":"嗯？難道是不是她們依靠占卜計算擊敗了數十隻熵嗎？"}]}],"next":"cpt_luna_04_01#56"},"cpt_luna_04_01#56":{"id":"cpt_luna_04_01